Here's a JavaScript code that removes the "(age X)" pattern from your string, where X can be any number:

```javascript
// Method 1: Using replace() with regex
function removeAge(text) {
    // This regex matches "(age " followed by one or more digits followed by ")"
    return text.replace(/\(age \d+\)/g, '');
}

// Method 2: More specific regex that handles edge cases
function removeAgeAdvanced(text) {
    // This regex matches "(age " followed by digits, optional spaces, and ")"
    // The \s* handles potential spaces, and the 'g' flag ensures all occurrences are replaced
    return text.replace(/\(age\s*\d+\s*\)/g, '');
}

// Method 3: If you want to preserve spacing
function removeAgeWithTrim(text) {
    // This removes the age part and also trims any double spaces that might result
    return text.replace(/\(age\s*\d+\s*\)/g, '').replace(/\s+/g, ' ').trim();
}

// Example usage:
const originalText = "july 7 1994 (age 7) London, UK (1994-07-07)";
console.log("Original:", originalText);
console.log("Method 1:", removeAge(originalText));
console.log("Method 2:", removeAgeAdvanced(originalText));
console.log("Method 3:", removeAgeWithTrim(originalText));

// Testing with different age numbers
const testCases = [
    "july 7 1994 (age 7) London, UK (1994-07-07)",
    "john doe (age 25) New York",
    "jane smith (age 103) Paris",
    "baby boy (age 1) Tokyo"
];

console.log("\nTesting with different ages:");
testCases.forEach(test => {
    console.log(`"${test}" => "${removeAge(test)}"`);
});
```

The key part is the regular expression `/\(age \d+\)/g`:
- `\(` - matches the literal opening parenthesis
- `age ` - matches the literal text "age " (including the space)
- `\d+` - matches one or more digits (0-9)
- `\)` - matches the literal closing parenthesis
- `g` - global flag to replace all occurrences (if there are multiple)

If you just need a simple one-liner:
```javascript
const result = "july 7 1994 (age 7) London, UK (1994-07-07)".replace(/\(age \d+\)/g, '');
console.log(result); // "july 7 1994  London, UK (1994-07-07)"
```

